      "id": "3gdKPGKPh9w6brxxjD2ZU",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Untrusted text is quarantined: fetched by code, read by a confined read-only subagent,\nrendered by code. No prose — from the model or the repo — can write the verdict.",
